WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.10 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Partnership monitoring, health checks and KPIs

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Measure the results and the relationship, from both sides.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Hold a short health check once or twice a year.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask the same questions each time to see trends.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Agree two or three actions after each check.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside and the council: both rate trust, fairness and value yearly; KPIs include items repaired and kg diverted.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You design a health check and partnership KPIs.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
